usage: free_or_cnf.py [-h] --free FREE --gates GATES [--seconds SECONDS] --tag
                      TAG [--pin PIN] [--prepare-only] [--require-helper]
                      [--productive] [--primary-minimal] [--fresh]
                      [--seed SEED] [--sat-preset] [--outdir OUTDIR]
                      [--scratch SCRATCH]

Exact Petersen vertex-deletion monotone synthesis with one free neighbor OR.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --free FREE        Comma-separated natural9 coordinates, e.g. 0,3 or 0,3,4
  --gates GATES
  --seconds SECONDS
  --tag TAG
  --pin PIN
  --prepare-only
  --require-helper
  --productive
  --primary-minimal
  --fresh
  --seed SEED
  --sat-preset
  --outdir OUTDIR
  --scratch SCRATCH
